OL,3,GNEWSAMum told to 'prepare for worst'
OL,4,Aurges others to get respiratory illness
OL,5,Avaccine
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman whose newborn daughter became
OL,8,Fill after catching a potentially
OL,9,Fserious respiratory illness is urging
OL,10,Fother pregnant women to make sure they
OL,11,Fare vaccinated against it.
OL,13,FJo Goldsmith said she was told to
OL,14,F"prepare for the worst" after her
OL,15,Fdaughter Phoebe contracted respiratory
OL,16,Fsyncytial virus (RSV) a few days after
OL,17,Fbeing born.
OL,19,FThe vaccine was not available at the
OL,20,Ftime of her pregnancy, but she said she
OL,21,F"definitely would have had it".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
